 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** The cost of ray tracing volumetric data using hierarchical enumeration grows linearly with the size of the image, logarithmically with the length of each ray, and linearly with the depth complexity of the data [S1, unofficial]. Adaptive termination reduces dependence on depth complexity [S1, unofficial].
